<!--
  T145 Main Road crossings fixture, near Box Hill (the features are invented; only the place is real).
  Roads running east, each about 300 m long, 300 m apart north to south:
    500 a primary road with crossing points mapped on it, at nodes not shared with any other way:
        102 crossing=zebra, 103 crossing=traffic_signals, 104 crossing=unmarked
    501 a primary road with traffic lights for vehicles only (122: traffic_signals, crossing=no) and
        junction lights (123: traffic_signals, no crossing tag)
    502 a trunk road
    503 a primary road with lanes=4
    504 a primary road, oneway=yes (one carriageway of a dual carriageway)
    505 a secondary road, lanes=2, with a crossing point that says there's no crossing (139)
    510 a residential road with a crossing point (152: highway=crossing), not a Main Road
    520 a pavement 5 m north of 500, beside it all the way
  osm2pgsql needs all nodes before all ways, each sorted by ID.
-->
